00:21:11,039 --> 00:21:13,039
Why don't you go to Huayue Tower for a meal

297
00:21:13,039 --> 00:21:14,119
before going back?

298
00:21:15,519 --> 00:21:15,920
Well...

299
00:21:17,400 --> 00:21:20,160
I'll take your advice.

300
00:21:22,640 --> 00:21:23,960
Thank you for your hospitality.

301
00:21:24,960 --> 00:21:25,799
I'll take my leave.

302
00:21:25,799 --> 00:21:26,440
Jiaojiao.

303
00:21:37,440 --> 00:21:39,200
Thank you for your help.

304
00:21:40,920 --> 00:21:42,079
I just want to know

305
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,920
how you're going to repay me.

306
00:21:48,440 --> 00:21:49,920
You just let them go like this?

307
00:21:51,960 --> 00:21:53,119
Zhang Xi Yun has spoken.

308
00:21:53,920 --> 00:21:56,240
I don't know what she's up to.

309
00:21:57,200 --> 00:21:58,200
Let's wait and see.

310
00:22:00,960 --> 00:22:01,599
Miss Zhang,

311
00:22:01,960 --> 00:22:03,960
may I return to the escort agency first?

312
00:22:04,400 --> 00:22:05,039
Oh?

313
00:22:05,960 --> 00:22:07,799
Shouldn't you come back to the villa with me?

314
00:22:08,640 --> 00:22:10,200
Now that Su Biaotou's life is uncertain,

315
00:22:10,559 --> 00:22:11,400
she has done me a favor.

316
00:22:11,599 --> 00:22:12,720
I can't just ignore it.

317
00:22:13,519 --> 00:22:15,559
It's also bad for the Nebula leader's reputation.

318
00:22:17,160 --> 00:22:18,440
Fine, go ahead.

319
00:22:19,079 --> 00:22:21,160
I'll come for you another day.

320
00:22:22,759 --> 00:22:23,720
Thank you, Miss Zhang.

321
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:24,359
Farewell.

322
00:22:29,240 --> 00:22:29,680
Yicheng,

323
00:22:29,720 --> 00:22:30,839
go find Meng Feifei

324
00:22:30,839 --> 00:22:31,759
and have her keep an eye on Bai Yanliang.

325
00:22:31,759 --> 00:22:32,559
Make sure he doesn't go to the agency.

326
00:22:32,559 --> 00:22:32,880
Okay, okay.

327
00:22:32,880 --> 00:22:33,519
Hurry up.

328
00:23:18,000 --> 00:23:20,039
That's how Yu got sick.

329
00:23:21,039 --> 00:23:23,000
That's how it was back then.

330
00:23:23,440 --> 00:23:24,240
Grandpa,

331
00:23:24,839 --> 00:23:25,960
Jiaojiao has been tough since childhood.

332
00:23:26,160 --> 00:23:27,200
She'll be fine.

333
00:23:30,359 --> 00:23:30,799
Grandpa,

334
00:23:31,559 --> 00:23:32,359
the doctor said

335
00:23:32,359 --> 00:23:33,319
there was no damage to the tendons.

336
00:23:34,160 --> 00:23:35,440
If she can get through these days,

337
00:23:35,880 --> 00:23:36,960
she'll recover.

338
00:23:37,640 --> 00:23:38,200
Grandpa,

339
00:23:39,720 --> 00:23:40,839
you should go back and rest.

340
00:23:41,359 --> 00:23:42,240
I'll stay with her.

341
00:24:09,920 --> 00:24:10,720
Jiao,

342
00:24:12,920 --> 00:24:14,039
you haven't stamped your palm,

343
00:24:15,599 --> 00:24:17,160
and we haven't gone home to see our parents.

344
00:24:18,759 --> 00:24:19,720
You can't have anything wrong.

345
00:24:20,559 --> 00:24:21,200
Do you know?

346
00:24:31,240 --> 00:24:32,039
Look at this.

347
00:24:32,559 --> 00:24:33,599
Oh, this one is good.

348
00:24:33,799 --> 00:24:35,240
These two are both pretty.

349
00:24:35,319 --> 00:24:36,519
How does it taste?

350
00:24:38,960 --> 00:24:41,119
-Listen to me.  -Let me see.

351
00:24:41,119 --> 00:24:41,920
It's good.

352
00:24:42,200 --> 00:24:44,359
Thank you, my sister.

353
00:24:57,000 --> 00:24:57,519
Follow me.

354
00:24:59,599 --> 00:25:00,720
She's still stuck in the escort agency.

355
00:25:00,799 --> 00:25:01,720
I have to save her.

356
00:25:01,920 --> 00:25:02,640
The young master said

357
00:25:02,839 --> 00:25:03,440
you can't go.

358
00:25:03,519 --> 00:25:04,039
Why?

359
00:25:04,200 --> 00:25:05,119
How are you going to save her?

360
00:25:05,519 --> 00:25:06,319
By acupuncture and decoction?

361
00:25:06,480 --> 00:25:07,920
or get caught by the soldiers?

362
00:25:09,279 --> 00:25:10,480
I can't just leave.

363
00:25:10,680 --> 00:25:12,279
Don't let the Sus get involved.

364
00:25:12,400 --> 00:25:13,160
Just save her.

365
00:25:24,920 --> 00:25:26,039
No one can get in or out.

366
00:25:27,160 --> 00:25:29,119
Sir, it's me.

367
00:25:29,200 --> 00:25:30,359
It's you.

368
00:25:30,960 --> 00:25:32,240
You won 3 taels of silver

369
00:25:32,240 --> 00:25:33,440
from me in the game last time.

370
00:25:34,759 --> 00:25:36,640
I didn't recognize you.

371
00:25:39,240 --> 00:25:39,799
This is

372
00:25:40,160 --> 00:25:41,279
to make amends to you.

373
00:25:47,599 --> 00:25:48,599
That's more like it.

374
00:25:50,359 --> 00:25:51,200
What do you want to do?

375
00:25:53,000 --> 00:25:54,000
I'm craving for wine.

376
00:25:56,519 --> 00:25:57,880
I'll be back in four hours.

377
00:25:59,079 --> 00:26:00,480
The deputy said

378
00:26:00,799 --> 00:26:02,240
no one can go out.

379
00:26:03,519 --> 00:26:05,599
He's going to fight against bandits.

380
00:26:05,920 --> 00:26:06,640
You know

381
00:26:06,960 --> 00:26:08,920
I never go out of the Imperial City.

382
00:26:09,200 --> 00:26:10,720
How could I have anything to do with bandits?

383
00:26:11,400 --> 00:26:12,920
I just want to eat something good.

384
00:26:14,000 --> 00:26:15,839
I'll bring you

385
00:26:16,039 --> 00:26:17,720
the best wine from Huayue Tower.

386
00:26:22,000 --> 00:26:22,680
Go and come back quickly.

387
00:26:23,839 --> 00:26:25,039
Thank you very much.

388
00:26:30,759 --> 00:26:31,720
Be gentle.

389
00:26:40,759 --> 00:26:42,200
Wasn't it agreed before

390
00:26:42,559 --> 00:26:43,720
to teach Su Yuejiao a lesson?

391
00:26:43,799 --> 00:26:44,640
When I become the head of the Escort Agency,

392
00:26:44,640 --> 00:26:45,920
I'll give you all the escort business in the city.

393
00:26:46,599 --> 00:26:48,480
How could you hurt her so badly?

394
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:51,400
And now the entire escort agency is shut down.

395
00:26:56,039 --> 00:26:58,039
It wasn't me who colluded with the bandits.

396
00:26:58,400 --> 00:27:00,720
She brought this on herself.

397
00:27:01,039 --> 00:27:01,720
Yeah.

398
00:27:02,240 --> 00:27:04,759
That's because I told you all this.

399
00:27:05,839 --> 00:27:07,319
You better tell the authorities

400
00:27:07,519 --> 00:27:08,559
and let us all go.

401
00:27:12,119 --> 00:27:13,000
You?

402
00:27:13,559 --> 00:27:14,880
tell me what to do?

403
00:27:17,920 --> 00:27:18,759
What do you mean?

404
00:27:19,920 --> 00:27:21,119
What Bai Yanliang did

405
00:27:21,119 --> 00:27:23,000
has nothing to do with us.

406
00:27:23,000 --> 00:27:24,839
If he can't be caught,

407
00:27:25,160 --> 00:27:27,000
the government won't let your family go.

408
00:27:27,519 --> 00:27:28,359
At that time,

409
00:27:28,559 --> 00:27:30,240
if you're not killed,

410
00:27:30,240 --> 00:27:32,599
you can come to Fuyun Escort Agency for a living.

411
00:27:33,200 --> 00:27:35,279
When I take your business,

412
00:27:36,000 --> 00:27:38,279
I won't be afraid of having one more useless person.

413
00:27:39,119 --> 00:27:39,480
You...

414
00:27:39,759 --> 00:27:40,960
You what?

415
00:27:42,160 --> 00:27:44,240
You are just a traitor!

416
00:27:48,200 --> 00:27:49,279
Humph!

417
00:27:50,960 --> 00:27:52,359
Get out of here!

418
00:27:53,640 --> 00:27:54,400
Fu Xiang,

419
00:27:54,599 --> 00:27:55,720
I'll kill you!

420
00:28:46,759 --> 00:28:47,319
Gloria.

421
00:28:48,160 --> 00:28:48,759
Gloria.

422
00:28:51,279 --> 00:28:52,039
You're awake.

423
00:28:52,720 --> 00:28:53,559
Do you want some water?

424
00:29:03,160 --> 00:29:03,680
Be careful.

425
00:29:06,599 --> 00:29:07,920
Is everyone okay?

426
00:29:10,160 --> 00:29:11,279
Everyone's fine.

427
00:29:11,759 --> 00:29:12,759
Only you are in trouble.

428
00:29:12,759 --> 00:29:13,680
You don't need to worry about others.

429
00:29:15,000 --> 00:29:16,119
You've been unconscious.

430
00:29:16,920 --> 00:29:18,240
Your grandfather and brother are worried about you.

431
00:29:20,279 --> 00:29:21,319
What about Bai Yanli?

432
00:29:23,079 --> 00:29:24,160
He ran away with his brother.

433
00:29:26,559 --> 00:29:27,240
It seems that

434
00:29:27,960 --> 00:29:29,440
he is the real White Wolf.

435
00:29:33,119 --> 00:29:34,799
Although he is reckless,

436
00:29:35,759 --> 00:29:37,240
he is not unforgivable.

437
00:29:38,559 --> 00:29:39,880
I gave him a hint before,

438
00:29:40,519 --> 00:29:41,640
so he kidnapped you

439
00:29:42,359 --> 00:29:43,400
to get rid of your relationship.

440
00:29:45,160 --> 00:29:46,160
Otherwise,

441
00:29:46,839 --> 00:29:48,119
we should all be in jail.

442
00:29:49,160 --> 00:29:50,400
I should have thought of it earlier.

443
00:29:51,039 --> 00:29:52,640
When we were preparing for the contest,

444
00:29:53,519 --> 00:29:56,640
I felt his moves were somewhat familiar.

445
00:29:57,559 --> 00:29:58,680
Now that I think about it,

446
00:29:59,160 --> 00:30:02,079
he must be the one who robbed the wedding.

447
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:06,160
It was me who kept him at the escort agency.

448
00:30:07,759 --> 00:30:09,240
It was me who ruined the escort agency.

449
00:30:14,119 --> 00:30:15,240
Don't overthink it.

450
00:30:15,960 --> 00:30:17,000
Focus on recovering first.

451
00:30:18,160 --> 00:30:18,920
As for the escort agency,

452
00:30:19,480 --> 00:30:20,279
I'll figure it out.

453
00:30:21,920 --> 00:30:23,119
He's a brigand.

454
00:30:24,759 --> 00:30:26,079
What can you do?

455
00:30:29,319 --> 00:30:30,079
You forget

456
00:30:31,200 --> 00:30:32,440
my father was a county sheriff.

457
00:30:33,599 --> 00:30:34,440
I have some connections

458
00:30:34,599 --> 00:30:35,960
in the officialdom.

459
00:30:37,640 --> 00:30:38,640
Now,

460
00:30:39,079 --> 00:30:40,200
as long as we can prove

461
00:30:40,359 --> 00:30:41,720
that Bai Yanliang's actions

462
00:30:42,000 --> 00:30:43,200
have nothing to do with the escort agency,

463
00:30:44,039 --> 00:30:45,039
we'll be fine.

464
00:30:46,119 --> 00:30:46,759
Jia

465
00:30:48,000 --> 00:30:48,720
Don't worry.

466
00:30:51,519 --> 00:30:53,240
I will protect the Escort Agency for you.

467
00:31:15,000 --> 00:31:15,640
Sir,

468
00:31:16,039 --> 00:31:16,920
may I ask

469
00:31:16,960 --> 00:31:18,960
if my son Li Shi went out today?

470
00:31:19,119 --> 00:31:21,240
I can't find him anywhere.

471
00:31:22,119 --> 00:31:23,240
We didn't see your son,

472
00:31:23,400 --> 00:31:24,440
and we didn't let him out to drink.

473
00:31:30,039 --> 00:31:30,400
Sir,

474
00:31:30,759 --> 00:31:31,119
Sir.

475
00:31:31,960 --> 00:31:32,640
Good wine.

476
00:31:33,119 --> 00:31:33,920
Come and try it.

477
00:31:34,599 --> 00:31:36,319
As happy as a god.

478
00:31:37,079 --> 00:31:37,519
Try it.

479
00:31:37,960 --> 00:31:38,799
Come in.

480
00:31:39,559 --> 00:31:40,640
I don't need your help.

481
00:31:41,119 --> 00:31:42,319
I don't need your help.

482
00:31:45,279 --> 00:31:46,200
I am

483
00:31:46,960 --> 00:31:49,480
the head escort of Su's Escort Agency.

484
00:31:52,720 --> 00:31:53,759
You...

485
00:31:54,039 --> 00:31:55,799
This is my mother's agency.

486
00:32:01,359 --> 00:32:02,200
Fu Xiang,

487
00:32:02,839 --> 00:32:04,240
what are you?

488
00:32:05,519 --> 00:32:07,000
You broke your promise

489
00:32:08,039 --> 00:32:09,839
and treated me like a dog.

490
00:32:11,160 --> 00:32:12,119
Gong Xi, Fa Cai.

491
00:32:13,319 --> 00:32:14,519
Grandpa.

492
00:32:15,400 --> 00:32:16,920
Take him inside.

493
00:32:17,160 --> 00:32:19,319
Call the others to the hall.

494
00:32:19,960 --> 00:32:20,559
Yes.

495
00:32:20,559 --> 00:32:21,079
Hurry up.

496
00:32:31,920 --> 00:32:32,880
Li Shi,

497
00:32:33,880 --> 00:32:35,119
have you slept enough?

498
00:32:35,640 --> 00:32:37,079
What did you do this afternoon?

499
00:32:41,079 --> 00:32:41,880
Li Shi,

500
00:32:43,839 --> 00:32:45,359
what did you do this afternoon?

501
00:32:46,119 --> 00:32:46,920
Tell me,

502
00:32:47,160 --> 00:32:48,720
what did you do?

503
00:32:54,880 --> 00:32:55,400
Dad.

504
00:33:02,079 --> 00:33:02,519
Dad

505
00:33:03,359 --> 00:33:04,039
I...

506
00:33:06,920 --> 00:33:08,039
Why did you let her out?

507
00:33:08,480 --> 00:33:09,200
She just woke up.

508
00:33:09,200 --> 00:33:09,960
Don't catch a cold.

509
00:33:13,680 --> 00:33:15,160
I wanted to come here.

510
00:33:21,960 --> 00:33:22,759
Grandpa

511
00:33:24,519 --> 00:33:26,319
He just went out for a walk.

512
00:33:27,839 --> 00:33:28,920
It's my fault

513
00:33:31,160 --> 00:33:32,440
that the escort agency was closed.

514
00:33:41,880 --> 00:33:43,359
You want to take over the escort agency,

515
00:33:44,279 --> 00:33:46,240
and now you want to take over the blame.

516
00:33:47,720 --> 00:33:49,359
Su Yuejiao,

517
00:33:49,680 --> 00:33:51,480
the escort agency doesn't belong to you alone.

518
00:33:51,680 --> 00:33:52,480
Yes,

519
00:33:54,279 --> 00:33:55,400
I didn't listen to you,

520
00:33:56,160 --> 00:33:57,480
and insisted on taking part in the contest.

521
00:33:58,359 --> 00:33:59,559
I don't deserve to be the head.

522
00:34:01,519 --> 00:34:02,640
The escort agency is yours,

523
00:34:05,200 --> 00:34:05,920
mine,

524
00:34:08,760 --> 00:34:09,360
Mine!

525
00:34:15,400 --> 00:34:16,039
Dad.

526
00:34:18,159 --> 00:34:18,800
Dad.

527
00:34:21,599 --> 00:34:24,119
It's my fault.

528
00:34:24,719 --> 00:34:26,320
I'm sorry.

529
00:34:27,599 --> 00:34:28,199
You...

530
00:34:28,840 --> 00:34:32,039
Did you just go out to find Fu Xiang?

531
00:34:35,639 --> 00:34:37,760
I was stupid.

532
00:34:38,119 --> 00:34:41,360
I shouldn't have trusted that jerk Fu Xiang,

533
00:34:43,599 --> 00:34:46,719
and told him about Bai Yanliang's identity,

534
00:34:46,880 --> 00:34:49,000
letting him ruin the agency.

535
00:34:54,960 --> 00:34:56,639
But I never intended to hurt Jiaojiao,

536
00:34:56,719 --> 00:34:59,599
let alone destroy the agency.

537
00:34:59,599 --> 00:35:01,239
Dad, what should we do?

538
00:35:03,320 --> 00:35:03,800
Dad.

539
00:35:07,920 --> 00:35:08,719
Dad.

540
00:35:12,719 --> 00:35:14,599
What should we do?

541
00:35:17,719 --> 00:35:19,880
Did you really do all this

542
00:35:20,800 --> 00:35:22,840
for the agency?

543
00:35:25,360 --> 00:35:27,280
You were never fit to be the head.

544
00:35:27,760 --> 00:35:28,960
Now it seems

545
00:35:29,159 --> 00:35:31,000
you don't deserve it at all.

546
00:35:34,039 --> 00:35:36,000
Our agency is a family.

547
00:35:37,000 --> 00:35:38,840
I filled those accounts for you

548
00:35:40,480 --> 00:35:43,199
because I didn't want outsiders to look down on the Su family

549
00:35:43,480 --> 00:35:45,280
and our agency.

550
00:35:51,119 --> 00:35:52,480
Now it seems

551
00:35:53,079 --> 00:35:56,239
that competition was a setup.

552
00:35:57,079 --> 00:35:59,480
Since we've already gotten involved,

553
00:36:00,400 --> 00:36:02,000
who's right and who's wrong

554
00:36:03,280 --> 00:36:04,320
doesn't matter anymore.

555
00:36:07,599 --> 00:36:08,880
We are a family

556
00:36:09,159 --> 00:36:10,719
behind closed doors.

557
00:36:11,920 --> 00:36:15,320
We should discuss how to get through the tough times together.

558
00:36:20,360 --> 00:36:23,559
Su Li, do you know you were wrong?

559
00:36:25,760 --> 00:36:27,400
Dad, I know I was wrong.

560
00:36:31,559 --> 00:36:33,239
How did you know about Bai Yanliang's identity?

561
00:36:37,800 --> 00:36:39,360
Bai Yanliang likes Jiaojiao.

562
00:36:40,840 --> 00:36:42,840
He was stood up by you on Qixi Festival.

563
00:36:43,519 --> 00:36:44,760
His brother persuaded him to leave.

564
00:36:45,519 --> 00:36:46,599
I overheard it.

565
00:36:48,039 --> 00:36:49,239
So, except for what you heard,

566
00:36:49,920 --> 00:36:51,480
Fu Xiang doesn't have any other evidence.

567
00:36:53,360 --> 00:36:54,679
Without proof of Bai Yanliang's involvement,

568
00:36:55,719 --> 00:36:56,480
the court

569
00:36:56,840 --> 00:36:58,519
can't easily convict the escort agency.

570
00:37:12,679 --> 00:37:13,480
Jiaojiao,

571
00:37:15,159 --> 00:37:17,159
are you willing to forgive your uncle?

572
00:37:30,880 --> 00:37:31,639
I'm not.
